				<r3d:description language="eng">LinguRep by the Research Center Deutscher Sprachatlas (DSA) at Marburg University is a specialist repository as it is specifically made to be a disciplinary repository for variationist linguistics, with a particular focus on German dialectology and sociolinguistics, geolinguistics and historical linguistics, but extending beyond this to encompass the entire field of areally oriented language variation research. Accordingly, the repository is designed to accommodate data from all categories and domains of language variation, encompassing both complex linguistic datasets and simpler collections of text, image, video, and audio materials.</r3d:description>
